# Point the iris gimbal camera straight down (T6, D30).
# List it after upstream's gazebo-iris-gimbal.parm (so these values win) but
# BEFORE the dds_*.parm files: AP_Param re-applies late-registered params
# (DDS_USE_NS among them) only if the LAST defaults file had one it could not
# yet place. Put this file last and the drone's topics silently lose /ap/vN.
# Upstream leaves MNT1_DEFLT_MODE at 3 (RC targeting), and nothing drives
# RC 6-8 in SITL. Neutral mode holds the angles below in the earth frame.
MNT1_DEFLT_MODE  1
MNT1_NEUTRAL_X   0
MNT1_NEUTRAL_Y   -90
MNT1_NEUTRAL_Z   0
